      "cooked": "<p>The former gladiators Sky-Scraper and Fashion team up.</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-292-writers-room-cosmic-tales-vol-2-525-526\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-292-writers-room-cosmic-tales-vol-2-525-526\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">theletterspage.libsyn.com</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/c/ca864864fd4764e914bcab3670be2db68d1c0662.jpeg\" class=\"thumbnail onebox-avatar\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\">\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-292-writers-room-cosmic-tales-vol-2-525-526\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">The Letters Page: Episode #292 - Writers' Room: Cosmic Tales Vol. 2 #525...</a></h3>\n\n  <p>Two issues? What an ideal number. Should would be a shame if someone came along who wanted THREE things instead...  Show Notes: Run Time: 1:48:33 Finally, you get to hear the story we crafted when we recorded this episode AND the Benchmark foes...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/e/e86f107519e50aaf8188e72dc285a0cd0e988dd3.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/e86f107519e50aaf8188e72dc285a0cd0e988dd3\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/e/e86f107519e50aaf8188e72dc285a0cd0e988dd3_2_322x500.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"xacJ5Fujj4mMmgj6RzsRcxF1niP\" width=\"322\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/e/e86f107519e50aaf8188e72dc285a0cd0e988dd3_2_322x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/e/e86f107519e50aaf8188e72dc285a0cd0e988dd3_2_483x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/e/e86f107519e50aaf8188e72dc285a0cd0e988dd3_2_644x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/e/e86f107519e50aaf8188e72dc285a0cd0e988dd3_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1920×2979 538 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>",
