    {
      "id": 260571,
      "name": "KateWalker",
      "username": "TakeWalker",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
      "created_at": "2024-09-03T18:20:09.281Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Seeing Kronz on a cover is really great. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\"> Somehow.</p>\n<p>Time, as they say, <em>is</em> a weird soup.</p>\n<p>You know, until Christopher mentioned S’sdari, I forgot that they might have a reason not to like each other. D: Now I’m sad! And they’re gonna flip by the end? DX I regret my vote! Let! Them! Be! Friends!</p>\n<p>I’m so proud of Christopher for recognizing “Dress Size” as a ship name before I could even start writing this note. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\"></p>\n<p>Being upset that someone died, not because they’re dead, but because you’ve only got two hostages now, is hilarious. XD</p>\n<p>Who could the minor not-a-hero be? <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/eyes.png?v=12\" title=\":eyes:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":eyes:\"> Time for fandom conspiracies!</p>\n<p>Ah, so the third element is a snatching a Ruin from the Grey.</p>\n<p>I feel like the sudden creation of the Lauretians is going to open up a whole can of fan question worms, and I’m here for it. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\"></p>\n<p>Ruin being earnestly positive and the most level-headed person in this story is everything I didn’t know I wanted. XD Vote unregretted!</p>\n<p>Them not knowing if he’s even actually dead is somehow even better.</p>\n<p>Clearing up the steampunk thing with Fashion is very helpful, I’ve basically been confused about her ever since they said that. Thank you for that!</p>\n<p>I definitely want Silver Age comics, everyone else is wrong! :V</p>\n<p>Australians don’t use rhyming slang? o_O Do they??</p>\n<p>Ooh, on-request musical stings! <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\"></p>\n<p>How did they know I’m sitting at home in a chair? <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/open_mouth.png?v=12\" title=\":open_mouth:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":open_mouth:\"></p>\n<p>…Okay, but it sounds like maybe they <em>should</em> make Bunker’s helmet out of notshootium? c_c Maybe the whole suit??</p>\n<p>Oh, my aching Sk8Mark!</p>",
