      "raw": "Seeing Kronz on a cover is really great. :D Somehow.\n\nTime, as they say, *is* a weird soup.\n\nYou know, until Christopher mentioned S'sdari, I forgot that they might have a reason not to like each other. D: Now I'm sad! And they're gonna flip by the end? DX I regret my vote! Let! Them! Be! Friends!\n\nI'm so proud of Christopher for recognizing \"Dress Size\" as a ship name before I could even start writing this note. :)\n\nBeing upset that someone died, not because they're dead, but because you've only got two hostages now, is hilarious. XD\n\nWho could the minor not-a-hero be? :eyes: Time for fandom conspiracies!\n\nAh, so the third element is a snatching a Ruin from the Grey.\n\nI feel like the sudden creation of the Lauretians is going to open up a whole can of fan question worms, and I'm here for it. :D\n\nRuin being earnestly positive and the most level-headed person in this story is everything I didn't know I wanted. XD Vote unregretted!\n\nThem not knowing if he's even actually dead is somehow even better.\n\nClearing up the steampunk thing with Fashion is very helpful, I've basically been confused about her ever since they said that. Thank you for that!\n\nI definitely want Silver Age comics, everyone else is wrong! :V\n\nAustralians don't use rhyming slang? o_O Do they??\n\nOoh, on-request musical stings! :D\n\nHow did they know I'm sitting at home in a chair? :O\n\n...Okay, but it sounds like maybe they *should* make Bunker's helmet out of notshootium? c_c Maybe the whole suit??\n\nOh, my aching Sk8Mark!",
