      "id": 260629,
      "name": "MindWanderer",
      "username": "MindWanderer",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mindwanderer/{size}/4816_2.png",
      "created_at": "2024-09-05T20:44:22.404Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"TakeWalker\" data-post=\"2\" data-topic=\"31071\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/48/5677_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> TakeWalker:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Clearing up the steampunk thing with Fashion is very helpful, I’ve basically been confused about her ever since they said that. Thank you for that!</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>IIRC that episode was the first one that communicated to me that Fashion wasn’t a throwaway joke, so I’m kind of sad to see it get retconned out of existence.</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"TakeWalker\" data-post=\"2\" data-topic=\"31071\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/48/5677_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> TakeWalker:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Who could the minor not-a-hero be? <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/eyes.png?v=12\" title=\":eyes:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":eyes:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Time for fandom conspiracies!</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>No need for conspiracies: Gregory Nolan. Someone really needs to go through the wiki and consolidate all the references to Nolan and Antimox.</p>",
      "post_number": 10,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2024-09-05T20:47:13.375Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": 2,
